{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And as for repeating.</b> A niphal form from the root of שנים (two), and its meaning is, the cows and the ears of grain too are for a witness that the matter is established, and because the two dreams came in a single night, for a witness that Elohim is hastening to do it."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:41.031793449Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}